        "Content": "Visit dngflanaganford.ie to register your interest & to see current offers, or place an offer on this property (please note offers can be placed once your registration has been approved, subject to conditions).\r\n\r\nWonderful 3 bedroom spacious bungalow set on a large half acre site with south facing back garden. This is an excellent location close to Carney Village with shops, restaurant, bars playing field, all within walking distance.\r\n\r\nDNG Flanagan Ford are delighted to present this fabulous, family home at Coolbeg, Drumcliffe, Co. Sligo. Set on a generous private site of just over half an acre, this spacious detached residence offers bright, well proportioned accommodation finished to an excellent standard.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall, bright living room with open fireplace and dual aspect windows, and a generous dining/living room with open fireplace and glazed sliding doors opening onto the south-facing rear garden. The fitted oak kitchen and adjoining utility room complete the living accommodation, with a cloakroom and hot press also provided.\r\n\r\nThere are three well proportioned bedrooms, two with en suite shower rooms, together with a well appointed main bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from PVC double glazing, oil fired central heating, mains water and a private septic tank. Outside, the generous south facing garden provides excellent space for outdoor family living, while the expansive site offers superb privacy.\r\n\r\nAn excellent family home in a highly desirable location, early viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nLocation\r\nCoolbeg enjoys a wonderfully peaceful yet convenient setting within the parish of Drumcliffe, close to the village of Carney and just a short drive north of Sligo town, making it an excellent base for family life in the North West. Carney village itself offers excellent local sporting facilities, with pitches catering for both soccer and Gaelic football, while a choice of well regarded primary schools serve the area, including those at Maugherow, Rathcormac and Grange. The area is also within easy reach of some of the North West's most celebrated attractions, including Lissadell House and Gardens, and the dramatic scenery and walking trails of Benbulben and Glencar. Sligo town, with its full range of shopping, schooling, commercial and leisure amenities, is within easy commuting distance, making this an excellent family home location.\r\n\r\nSize\r\n116.16 sqm - 1250 sqft\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\n4.70m x 1.70m (15.42ft x 5.58ft)\r\nTiled flooring; extends by a further 6.5m x 1m section finished with carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n4.20m x 4.50m (13.78ft x 14.76ft)\r\nCarpet flooring; bay window to front and gable window; open fireplace with cast iron, tile and wood surround\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Area\r\n3.40m x 5.40m (11.15ft x 17.72ft)\r\nTiled flooring; open fireplace with tile, cast iron and wood surround; gable window; glazed sliding doors to the south-facing rear, with views over the rear garden, fields and Knocknarea Mountain\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n2.60m x 3.30m (8.53ft x 10.83ft)\r\nTiled flooring; fitted oak kitchen with integrated oven and hob; large south-facing window with magnificent views.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\n1.50m x 2.70m (4.92ft x 8.86ft)\r\nTiled flooring; fitted units; plumbed for washing machine and dryer; wash hand basin; broom cupboard; door to rear\r\n\r\nCloakroom\r\nOff the entrance hallway\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.40m x 3.30m (11.15ft x 10.83ft)\r\nCarpet flooring; en suite shower room off\r\n\r\nEn-Suite 1\r\n1.40m x 2.30m (4.59ft x 7.55ft)\r\nTiled flooring and tiled walls; toilet, wash hand basin and corner shower\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.40m x 3.40m (11.15ft x 11.15ft)\r\nCarpet flooring; en suite shower room off\r\n\r\nEn-Suite 2\r\n1.50m x 1.80m (4.92ft x 5.91ft)\r\nTiled flooring and tiled walls; toilet, wash hand basin and corner shower\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n3.40m x 3.00m (11.15ft x 9.84ft)\r\nCarpet flooring; south-facing, overlooking the rear garden and views beyond\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom\r\n3.40m x 1.60m (11.15ft x 5.25ft)\r\nTiled flooring and tiled walls; toilet, wash hand basin, bath and bidet\r\n\r\nHotpress\r\nOff the entrance hallway\r\n\r\nDirections: F91D3A2"
